# MFA Platform — ML & scoring rules

Reference: **`docs/SIGNALS.md`**, **`docs/ADRS.md`** (ADR-001, ADR-002)

## Pipeline order

```
Rules engine → XGBoost/LightGBM ensemble → Confidence calibrator → Tier mapping
```

LLM is **not** in the classification path.

## Classifier targets (baseline milestone)

- Precision ≥ 85%, Recall ≥ 70% on gold-label set (see `docs/ROADMAP.md`)
- Store SHAP or rule contributions in `top_signals`

## Feature handling

- Missing enrichment → `null` (not 0); document imputation strategy
- Train/val split by **domain** to prevent leakage
- Page-level features, not domain aggregates alone

## Tier mapping

| Score band | Tier | Action |
|------------|------|--------|
| High confidence + high score | `MFA_High` | block |
| Medium | `MFA_Medium` | HITL |
| Low score | `MFA_Low` / `Non_MFA` | monitor / allow |
| Low confidence | `Uncertain` | HITL |

## Model artifacts

Version models in `ml/artifacts/{version}/` with metadata: training date, feature schema version, metrics.

## Do not

- Use LLM output as classification label
- Train on industry blocklists as sole ground truth
- Deploy without shadow-mode evaluation — TODO(MVP); see `docs/ROADMAP.md`
